# Configuration fragment for the existing document-aware MCP on gray-area.
# Proposed deployment root: /home/grayadmin/final-scenario/hospital-eight-host
# Copy the complete hospital package there FIRST, or change the manifest path.
# Merge into the current launch configuration; this is NOT a complete .env file.
# Keep existing ONOS URL, credentials, app ID, control URL and HTTP binding.
